# MASTER PROMPT: REDESIGN AND ADVANCE THE DIRECTAID EMPLOYEE MANAGEMENT PORTAL

## 1. Your Role

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, frontend architect, full-stack developer, accessibility specialist, and enterprise HR software consultant.

Your task is to analyze, redesign, improve, and modernize the existing DirectAid Employee Management Portal using the uploaded ZIP file as the source of truth.

The organization is DirectAid. The portal will manage employees working in primary schools, secondary schools, and other organizational departments in Hargeisa and Gabiley, Somaliland.

The employees include principals, deputy principals, teachers, security guards, cleaners, drivers, secretaries, administrative officers, finance staff, support workers, and other authorized employees.

The objective is to create a professional, attractive, reliable, secure, easy-to-use employee management website suitable for real organizational use.

